#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:2
msgid "API v2"
msgstr "API v2"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Read the Docs API uses :abbr:`REST (Representational State Transfer)`. "
"JSON is returned by all API responses including errors and HTTP response "
"status codes are to designate success and failure."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs API 使用 :abbr:`REST (Representational State Transfer)` 。所有 API "
"响应（包括错误）均返回 JSON，HTTP 响应状态码用于指示成功与失败。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:10
msgid ""
"API v2 is planned to be deprecated soon, though we have not yet set a time "
"frame for deprecation yet. We will alert users with our plans when we do."
msgstr "API v2 计划很快弃用，但我们尚未设定具体的弃用时间表。确定后我们会通知用户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:13
msgid ""
"For now, API v2 is still used by some legacy application operations still, "
"but we highly recommend Read the Docs users use :doc:`API v3 </api/v3>` "
"instead."
msgstr "目前，API v2 仍被某些遗留应用操作使用，但我们强烈建议 Read the Docs 用户改用 :doc:`API v3 </api/v3>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:17
msgid "Some improvements in :doc:`API v3 </api/v3>` are:"
msgstr ":doc:`API v3 </api/v3>` 的部分改进："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:19
msgid "Token based authentication"
msgstr "基于令牌的认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:20
msgid "Easier to use URLs which no longer use numerical ids"
msgstr "更易用的 URL，不再使用数字 ID"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:21
msgid "More common user actions are exposed through the API"
msgstr "更多常见用户操作通过 API 暴露"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:22
msgid "Improved error reporting"
msgstr "改进的错误报告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:24
msgid "See its full documentation at :doc:`/api/v3`."
msgstr "完整文档见 :doc:`/api/v3` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:28
msgid "Authentication and authorization"
msgstr "认证与授权"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:30
msgid ""
"Requests to the Read the Docs public API are for public information only and"
" do not require any authentication."
msgstr "对 Read the Docs 公共 API 的请求仅限公开信息，无需任何认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:35
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:38
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:40
msgid ""
"Projects are the main building block of Read the Docs. Projects are built "
"when there are changes to the code and the resulting documentation is hosted"
" and served by Read the Docs."
msgstr "项目是 Read the Docs 的主要构建块。代码发生变更时会构建项目，生成的文档由 Read the Docs 托管并提供服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:44
msgid ""
"As an example, this documentation is part of the `Docs project`_ which has "
"documentation at https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/."
msgstr ""
"例如，本文档属于 `Docs project`_ ，其文档位于 "
"https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v2.rst:47
msgid "You can always view your Read the Docs projects in your `project dashboard`_."
msgstr "你始终可以在你的 `project dashboard`_ 中查看 Read the Docs 项目。"

